), but not too exposed due to the dwarf pines. There are no markings. A feel for the itinerary is required. Often wet and precarious. On the upper part belaying is possible (dwarf pines).","download_end":false,"download_start":false,"geom":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[2695737.5769999996,1209413.0289999992],[2695735.4019999988,1209414.0280000009],[2695733.3630000018,1209415.6719999984],[2695731.9010000005,1209417.5289999992],[2695729.3090000004,1209419.938000001],[2695724.8640000001,1209423.0850000009],[2695718.9360000007,1209425.493999999],[2695708.1950000003,1209428.2710000016],[2695696.5260000005,1209431.6050000004],[2695690.2300000004,1209432.1609999985],[2695684.8590000011,1209432.1609999985],[2695681.7100000009,1209433.0859999992],[2695679.1180000007,1209434.9389999993],[2695677.4499999993,1209438.6429999992],[2695675.5980000012,1209444.199000001],[2695674.8579999991,1209449.3850000016],[2695673.7459999993,1209453.4600000009],[2695670.2280000001,1209458.0899999999],[2695665.7829999998,1209463.2760000005],[2695662.449000001,1209469.7580000013],[2695659.1149999984,1209474.574000001],[2695653.9290000014,1209479.3889999986],[2695649.4840000011,1209483.0929999985],[2695643.3709999993,1209489.7600000016],[2695639.4829999991,1209495.3159999996],[2695636.3339999989,1209498.6499999985],[2695630.2210000008,1209503.8359999992],[2695627.4439999983,1209506.243999999],[2695625.9629999995,1209508.6530000009],[2695625.5909999982,1209512.1710000001],[2695624.1099999994,1209516.800999999],[2695621.3310000002,1209521.6160000004],[2695617.2580000013,1209526.0610000007],[2695610.4050000012,1209532.7289999984],[2695606.5150000006,1209535.5080000013],[2695604.4780000001,1209538.6559999995],[2695603.1810000017,1209544.2129999995],[2695602.0700000003,1209551.4349999987],[2695599.4780000001,1209555.5100000016],[2695596.5139999986,1209558.4730000012],[2695594.2910000011,1209562.1779999994],[2695592.995000001,1209567.9189999998],[2695589.8460000008,1209573.4750000015],[2695586.142